---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact — World Cup Draft Simulator"
  description="Contact World Cup Draft Simulator with feedback, bug reports and questions about the fantasy football World Cup draft simulation game."
>

<main class="min-h-screen bg-canvas text-white">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 text-center">
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[1.8px] text-mint uppercase">
      Contact
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-5xl leading-[0.9] tracking-[1.07px] sm:text-6xl">
      Get in touch
    </h1>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl space-y-4 text-secondary">
      <p>
        Feedback, bug reports, ideas or questions? World Cup Draft Simulator is a
        free online soccer game and a browser soccer game. You draft and simulate
        your own World Cup. We would love to hear from you. This is a fantasy
        football world cup project built by fans. Every message shapes what the
        soccer simulator becomes next.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may have found us as a soccer draft game, a free soccer simulation
        game or an interactive soccer simulator. The door is open. Tell us a squad
        that feels wrong. Tell us a match that swung too far. Or tell us a feature
        the football draft simulator should add. There is no account. No download
        to reinstall. Reaching out is as quick as playing a round.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <a
        href="mailto:contact@example.com?subject=World%20Cup%20Draft%20Simulator%20Feedback"
        class="inline-block rounded-full bg-mint px-8 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[1.8px] text-black uppercase transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-white"
      >
        Email us
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-md border-t border-white/10 pt-8 text-left">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[1.5px] text-secondary uppercase">
        Email
      </p>
        <p class="mt-1">
          <a class="text-mint underline" href="mailto:contact@example.com">contact@example.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-md space-y-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 text-left text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary">
        <p>
          When you write in, a few details help us act fast. If a match in the
          world cup simulation felt off, tell us the formations. Tell us the
          round — group stage or knockout bracket. Then we can see how the match
          engine decided it. If a player rating looks wrong, name the squad and
          the position. The football simulator compares every draft on one scale.
          One wrong rating can tilt a tournament.
        </p>
        <p>
          Feature ideas are welcome too. More old squads. Extra football
          formations. A deeper penalty shootout simulator. Or a way to share your
          finished cup. All are on the table for a world cup fantasy game that
          keeps growing. We also love hearing from communities. Groups that run a
          fantasy soccer draft. Coaches of a youth side. Anyone who wants a free
          browser soccer game for the classroom or the locker room.
        </p>
        <p>
          The online soccer game runs on any device. No sign-up. So it fits a
          lesson or a match-day warm-up. This is a soccer game with no download.
          You can open it, play a round, and tell us what to change in the same
          sitting. However you found us — as a world cup simulator, a soccer draft
          game, or the easiest interactive soccer simulator to open between
          matches — your notes make the next build better. Get in touch. Help shape
          the app you play.
        </p>
      </div>
  </section>
</main></Layout>
